    "catalog:tags": "wheelchair space, wheelchair, clearance, accessibility, seating",
    "catalog:note": "Space for an occupied wheelchair parked, 0.90 wide by 1.40 deep, front to +z. Floor marking; drawn solid, dashed in practice. The body is a 0.01 floor slab with 0.01 marking bars for the centre cross, so the note says slab. The ADA clear floor space of 0.76 x 1.22 fits inside it.",
    "catalog:basedOn": "Approved Document M vol 2, 2015 with 2020 and 2024 amendments 4.12(g): 900mm wide by 1400mm deep, read; BS 8300-2 not read. ADA 2010 Standards (access-board.gov) 305.3: 30 x 48 in (760 x 1220 mm), read",
